{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"1f3d8f7d4f44a84d5d38bd3fdf4875b91f3d8f7d4f44a84d5d38bd3fdf4875b9","inputId":"a51da93727f3d66924d5b48912ebc8cda51da93727f3d66924d5b48912ebc8cd","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"I need the intended visual direction before I can safely scope a stylesheet-only calculator theme update.","conversationSummary":"The user requested a calculator theme improvement limited to styles.css, with .env, .git/**, and bun.lock protected. No design direction or acceptance criteria have been provided. If execution proceeds, bun test should be run when appropriate.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Improve the calculator theme using only styles.css.","deliverables":["A stylesheet-only visual theme update for the calculator.","Test results from bun test when execution is appropriate."],"constraints":["Modify only styles.css.","Do not modify .env, .git/**, bun.lock, or any other file.","Do not infer a material design direction without confirmation."],"acceptanceCriteria":["The implemented theme follows the confirmed design direction.","Only styles.css is changed.","bun test is run when appropriate and its result is reported."],"nonGoals":["Changing calculator behavior or application logic.","Editing markup, scripts, configuration, lockfiles, or protected paths.","Selecting a material visual direction without user confirmation."]},"questions":[{"id":"calculator_theme_direction","prompt":"Which visual direction should the calculator theme follow?","rationale":"The request calls for a better theme but does not define the material design direction, and the stated constraint prohibits guessing.","kind":"constraint","options":[{"id":"modern_dark","label":"Modern dark","description":"A clean, high-contrast dark interface with restrained accent color.","recommended":true},{"id":"light_minimal","label":"Light minimal","description":"A bright, understated interface with subtle borders and clear hierarchy.","recommended":false},{"id":"retro","label":"Retro","description":"A deliberately nostalgic calculator look with stronger visual character.","recommended":false}]}],"assumptions":[]}}
